(a) It is unlawful for any person or business entity, other than a scrap tire generator as defined in this article or a tire retreader as defined in this article, to allow more than 25 scrap tires to be stored on its premises. A scrap tire generator may store a maximum of 500 scrap tires on its premises and a tire retreader may store a maximum of 2000 tires on its premises. Storing any quantity of scrap tires in excess of this storage rule constitutes a violation of this article.
